d><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Checks if all bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Checks if any bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Checks if none of the bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if all bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if any of the bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if none of the bits are set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"0000\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"0101\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b3<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"1111\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>\n        <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"bitset<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"all<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"any<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"none<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n        <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b1 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b1.<span c